      {
        "id": "scrap-the-ranger-fit-a-cheap-used-engine-or-spend-more-for-reliability",
        "title": "Scrap the Ranger, fit a cheap used engine, or spend more for reliability-",
        "description": "The truck was worth around £8,000-£12,000 before failure. The owner needed it back as a daily driver and work vehicle, but did not have the budget for a reconditioned engine.",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "src": "/case-studies/assets/5.2-ford-ranger-32-decision-paths.png",
            "alt": "Ford Ranger 3.2 repair decision - engine only at £3,800 with turbo risk versus engine and turbo at £4,500 with peace of mind",
            "width": "",
            "height": ""
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Scrap the vehicle"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Path 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Sell non-running as spares/repair. Return: £1,500-£3,000."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Low-mileage used engine"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Path 2 - chosen"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "£3,800 fitted. Chosen compromise for speed and cost. Timeline: 5-7 days."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Budget could not stretch to reconditioned"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Why"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "A £4,500-£6,000+ reconditioned route offered better reliability but was unaffordable. The owner agreed to change oil every 6,000 miles going forward."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "£8,000-£12,000"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Vehicle value"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Truck value before failure set the ceiling for repair spend."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "30-40%"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Repair ratio"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "£3,800 was roughly 30-40% of pre-failure value - within the watch zone."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Daily + work"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Usage"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "The owner needed the truck back quickly as a daily driver and work vehicle."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Limited"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Budget"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Could not afford £5,000+ for a reconditioned engine with new oil pump."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Turbo unknown"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Contamination risk"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Turbo had likely run without oil; owner accepted future failure risk."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "£3,800"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Total paid"
          },
          {
